WEBVTT

00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:55.596
Jiro, you sought strength,
did you not?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.570
What have you gained
from that strength?

00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:01.326
Have you gained anything
from carrying out your revenge?

00:02:02.066 --> 00:02:03.266
Shut up!

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.370
Shu...

00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:10.233
You were fighting to
protect everyone

00:02:10.266 --> 00:02:13.766
and to keep sadness
from spreading, right?

00:02:15.366 --> 00:02:18.926
You're now responsible for
so much sadness in the world!

00:02:19.233 --> 00:02:20.433
Do you understand that?!

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:22.133
You're wrong.

00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:23.226
Huh?!

00:02:25.566 --> 00:02:28.366
By allowing the Darkness
to take over,

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.830
all conflict and sadness
will be gone.

00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:34.933
Concern over useless emotions
will be no more.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.870
By surrendering yourself
to the Darkness...

00:02:36.933 --> 00:02:38.773
By letting the Darkness
take the reign,

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.530
the various antinomies running
rampant in the human world

00:02:41.566 --> 00:02:42.566
will be no more.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:47.700
An orderly and righteous world
lies there.

00:02:48.933 --> 00:02:51.673
Then why does the Darkness
absorb people?

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.470
Of course there won't be
conflict or struggle

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.370
if everything gets swallowed up
and there's nothing left.

00:02:59.566 --> 00:03:05.696
You can't have conflict when
there's nobody left in the world.

00:03:05.933 --> 00:03:07.473
- A world like that
- A world like that

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.230
- is meaningless to us!
- is meaningless to us!

00:03:11.533 --> 00:03:13.573
Shu! Let's settle this now!

00:03:13.766 --> 00:03:14.766
Yeah!

00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:18.233
We've gotta put everything
into this one shot!

00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:20.503
Conquer!

00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:26.996
Blue Explosion!

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.133
- Go!
- Go!

00:03:56.766 --> 00:03:58.126
No way.

00:03:58.866 --> 00:04:00.996
She stopped that
with her bare hands?!

00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:05.433
You've gotta be kidding...
She stopped our best shot.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:13.030
This is the power of the Darkness.
Don't you think it's wonderful?

00:04:16.766 --> 00:04:18.796
It seems words aren't enough
to convince you.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.830
If that's the case, then get
a firsthand taste of it yourself!

00:04:24.133 --> 00:04:25.673
How inconvenient.

00:04:26.133 --> 00:04:27.803
You can't even get
inside the Darkness

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:29.433
without the help
of a machine.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.930
I'll be busting that.

00:04:37.033 --> 00:04:41.933
BONDS

00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:50.933
What's this?!

00:04:51.233 --> 00:04:53.573
I'm being eaten...by the Darkness?!

00:04:55.266 --> 00:04:58.126
Shu!

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.433
Do you hate me, Jiro?

00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:06.826
Rest assured.

00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:10.996
There's no hatred or sadness
inside the Darkness.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.300
Zo...la...

00:05:27.566 --> 00:05:29.396
All of you should go, too.

00:05:46.933 --> 00:05:48.133
It's over.

00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:51.603
I shall never see any of you again.

00:05:55.266 --> 00:05:57.066
May the Darkness
bestow its blessings.

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:19.433
There's still more?

00:06:19.966 --> 00:06:23.896
Sir Conrad,
isn't it time we retreat?

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:25.200
Retreat?

00:06:25.566 --> 00:06:27.596
And where are we supposed to
retreat to, exactly?

00:06:28.133 --> 00:06:29.773
Well, I just thought...

00:06:29.933 --> 00:06:32.933
Whatever happens,
we have to stay right here!

00:06:34.933 --> 00:06:37.473
In order to save
even one more person!

00:06:38.633 --> 00:06:40.633
Shu and his friends!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.570
They will clear a new path for us!

00:06:44.633 --> 00:06:45.303
Shu!

00:06:45.733 --> 00:06:47.103
I won't give up!

00:06:47.466 --> 00:06:48.966
Until the last minute
of the last hour!

00:06:59.533 --> 00:07:01.103
The energy output has
reached its limits?!

00:07:01.666 --> 00:07:03.726
W-What's that?!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:09.870
The ships!

00:07:10.733 --> 00:07:13.203
The Darkness! It's...!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.230
Mommy!

00:07:29.466 --> 00:07:31.596
Shu... I'll leave the rest to you.

00:07:32.466 --> 00:07:33.996
Shu!

00:07:49.566 --> 00:07:52.096
Where...am I?

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:58.500
What is this?!

00:08:01.566 --> 00:08:03.896
You're inside the Darkness.

00:08:03.933 --> 00:08:05.603
The Darkness?!

00:08:07.866 --> 00:08:09.366
What happened to the others?!

00:08:10.266 --> 00:08:11.696
Don't worry.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:17.000
They're all in the same place.
All here inside the Darkness.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.030
Is that so?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.600
Then tell me.

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:23.826
What kind of joke is this thing
attached to my body?

00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:26.573
Don't you understand, Blue Dragon?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.830
You have become free.

00:08:30.066 --> 00:08:31.226
Free, you say?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.100
Yes, free.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.870
The way you are now is the way
you were originally intended to be.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:40.400
You can move freely without
being shackled to anyone.

00:08:40.433 --> 00:08:43.403
You don't have to follow
someone's orders.

00:08:44.266 --> 00:08:48.096
The spell that held you captive
no longer exists.

00:08:49.366 --> 00:08:54.366
Blue Dragon, you have reassumed
your original form.

00:08:55.433 --> 00:08:59.503
You were worshipped since
time immemorial as the legend,

00:08:59.533 --> 00:09:02.573
as the embodiment of destruction,
Blue Dragon.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.000
Your menacing form
strikes terror in others.

00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:11.473
Your proud roar causes
friend and foe alike to tremble.

00:09:11.766 --> 00:09:16.126
And your blue fire leaves behind
only scorched earth...

00:09:16.833 --> 00:09:20.073
Your nature to destroy
knows no bounds,

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.770
and you'll keep destroying
for the sake of destroying

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:24.770
until there's nothing
left to destroy.

00:09:26.066 --> 00:09:31.466
Since the dawn of history,
you were a being feared by all...

00:09:32.133 --> 00:09:35.673
You haven't forgotten that,
have you?

00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:37.333
I have.

00:09:37.733 --> 00:09:41.333
I don't know why, but I have no
recollection of the distant past.

00:09:42.133 --> 00:09:43.233
Is that so?

00:09:43.266 --> 00:09:44.966
It is an inconvenient thing
to be a Shadow.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.170
Hey, you! Show yourself!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.770
It's hard to talk like this!

00:09:50.866 --> 00:09:52.166
Very well.

00:09:55.066 --> 00:09:56.066
You?!

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:01.203
Killer Bat!

00:10:02.033 --> 00:10:03.173
Why, you!

00:10:05.066 --> 00:10:06.266
Quit fooling around!

00:10:06.866 --> 00:10:09.866
There's no time for this!

00:10:11.733 --> 00:10:13.703
I have more time than
I know what to do with.

00:10:14.366 --> 00:10:16.696
I was sealed away
for 350,000 years.

00:10:17.766 --> 00:10:22.626
Compared to that and the future
to come, this is nothing.

00:10:28.233 --> 00:10:29.773
Where's Shu?

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.830
What?

00:10:30.866 --> 00:10:33.266
I'm asking you where Shu is!

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:36.033
Haven't you realized?

00:10:36.266 --> 00:10:37.426
Realize what?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.600
That you've swallowed him up?

00:10:50.933 --> 00:10:52.773
Where am I?

00:10:54.066 --> 00:10:54.726
Oh, I see...

00:10:55.233 --> 00:10:56.233
It's just like...

00:10:57.066 --> 00:10:58.426
that time before...

00:11:00.166 --> 00:11:04.196
I've been swallowed up...
by Blue Dragon.

00:11:13.866 --> 00:11:16.126
That's...Killer Bat?!

00:11:16.633 --> 00:11:19.603
What do you mean?
What on earth is going on?!

00:11:20.266 --> 00:11:22.666
You have been absorbed
by the Darkness.

00:11:23.433 --> 00:11:27.973
And the spell that forced you
to serve humans has been broken.

00:11:29.033 --> 00:11:31.233
All that remains is for you
to make a choice.

00:11:33.233 --> 00:11:34.433
Blue Dragon...

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.830
I will give you knowledge.

00:11:38.266 --> 00:11:41.666
When you see it,
you'll know which path to take.

00:11:42.033 --> 00:11:43.233
Knowledge?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.330
This is...

00:11:52.533 --> 00:11:55.703
Information is...
streaming into my head!

00:11:57.233 --> 00:12:01.773
We creatures of the Darkness lived
without being shackled to anyone.

00:12:02.833 --> 00:12:05.273
We had complete freedom.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.530
Each individual simply did
whatever their hearts desired.

00:12:10.366 --> 00:12:13.396
But we lost the battle to
the Shadow Wielders,

00:12:13.433 --> 00:12:16.373
and the world fell under
the control of humanity,

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.300
as it has been for ages.

00:12:20.966 --> 00:12:22.896
And what has been
the result of that?

00:12:23.333 --> 00:12:25.473
Humanity has sat complacently
atop its throne,

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.000
and neglected to evolve.

00:12:28.633 --> 00:12:30.803
It has created countless
trifling systems of order

00:12:30.833 --> 00:12:33.233
that spawned myriad
of inconsistencies

00:12:33.266 --> 00:12:35.126
and they were simply
allowed to stand.

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.670
The frivolous battles
between humans

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.770
showed no signs
of ending.

00:12:43.533 --> 00:12:46.833
They devoured the world.

00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:49.596
Why am I seeing this?

00:12:52.433 --> 00:12:53.433
What's this?!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.900
Am I being fused with Blue Dragon?!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:01.770
Through Zola's work, humanity has
almost completely been eliminated.

00:13:02.733 --> 00:13:06.403
All that remains is for you
to agree to follow our will.

00:13:06.733 --> 00:13:10.233
And we'll prepare for the battle
that will usher in a new age.

00:13:13.233 --> 00:13:17.203
The world will enter
a new phase now.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.200
Decide, Blue Dragon.

00:13:20.566 --> 00:13:22.496
There is nothing that
can stand in the way

00:13:22.533 --> 00:13:24.803
of your desire to
destroy now!

00:13:26.533 --> 00:13:28.003
Now, decide!

00:13:28.233 --> 00:13:30.673
You're the honorable
embodiment of destruction!

00:13:32.433 --> 00:13:34.533
I see now. I understand.

00:13:35.233 --> 00:13:37.333
So I am the embodiment
of destruction, correct?

00:13:37.833 --> 00:13:38.833
Yes.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:43.270
You embody the destruction itself!
You are the incarnation of it!

00:13:43.333 --> 00:13:45.903
You are the direct descendant
of the great Darkness!

00:13:45.933 --> 00:13:48.133
You have the potential
to destroy everything!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.230
Okay, I get it.

00:13:51.666 --> 00:13:53.126
I'll show you destruction.

00:13:54.633 --> 00:13:58.433
I'll start by destroying
this stupid world!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.330
What?!

00:14:00.566 --> 00:14:01.726
What're you doing, Shu?

00:14:02.166 --> 00:14:04.596
Stop playing around
and come here, now!

00:14:10.133 --> 00:14:11.133
I know!

00:14:16.733 --> 00:14:19.503
Why? Why would you reject freedom?!

00:14:19.633 --> 00:14:21.473
What are you thinking?!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.200
I embody destruction.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:27.570
Which means, I can even destroy
this stupid world if I wanted to!

00:14:28.466 --> 00:14:30.566
I'm not taking orders from anyone.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.330
I'll do as I please. End of story!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:38.100
It's futile.
You can't get out of here.

00:14:44.033 --> 00:14:46.773
Blue Dragon, you're throwing away
your freedom

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.830
for something like that?!

00:14:48.866 --> 00:14:51.296
Something as trifling as that?!

00:14:51.333 --> 00:14:52.833
Too bad for you.

00:14:53.133 --> 00:14:56.633
But I kinda like fighting
along side him.

00:15:08.966 --> 00:15:09.626
What?!

00:15:18.633 --> 00:15:20.373
Let's beat him down, Shu!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.830
Yeah! Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:15:27.866 --> 00:15:29.866
Everyone! Wake up!

00:15:32.233 --> 00:15:32.903
Shu!

00:15:33.566 --> 00:15:34.226
Shu!

00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:35.226
Shu!

00:15:35.666 --> 00:15:36.326
Shu!

00:15:42.033 --> 00:15:43.733
Impossible.

00:16:15.166 --> 00:16:16.326
What's this?!

00:16:20.166 --> 00:16:21.326
Maro!

00:16:23.433 --> 00:16:25.233
We're back!

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.600
Shu!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:49.030
Who'd think you could return from
the Darkness just as you are.

00:16:49.866 --> 00:16:51.796
And you didn't get absorbed
by the Darkness,

00:16:51.833 --> 00:16:53.333
even without your medallions.

00:16:53.933 --> 00:16:56.973
Perhaps I've underestimated
the Soldiers of Light.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.900
I saw it, Zola.
Through Blue Dragon's eyes.

00:17:02.433 --> 00:17:04.433
I saw the true form of this world.

00:17:06.966 --> 00:17:07.966
And...

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:11.730
Papa! Papa!

00:17:11.766 --> 00:17:12.766
...you were there, too.

00:17:14.866 --> 00:17:18.466
You were wandering
alone in the dark.

00:17:19.533 --> 00:17:24.003
And the old Zola there was lost in
the deep sadness and loneliness.

00:17:24.933 --> 00:17:26.503
You were swallowed up
by the Darkness.

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.900
In the Darkness, there is
neither sadness nor hatred.

00:17:31.866 --> 00:17:35.366
You just lost your father,

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.070
and there was nothing else
you could rely on.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:47.930
I finally understand why you were
swallowed up by the Darkness.

00:17:48.866 --> 00:17:49.866
Oh, I see...

00:17:50.466 --> 00:17:52.066
Your longing for the past world

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.730
is the reason why you
brought everyone back.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.200
No, that's not it.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.370
We have something precious,

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.770
Something that you
didn't have back then.

00:18:03.766 --> 00:18:05.026
And that's friends!

00:18:16.566 --> 00:18:20.526
Do you really think the bonds of friendship
can surpass the Darkness?

00:18:20.566 --> 00:18:21.566
Yes, I do, Zola.

00:18:22.233 --> 00:18:24.273
Our Shadows are our friends.

00:18:24.966 --> 00:18:26.426
Unlike your Shadow, Zola.

00:18:26.766 --> 00:18:27.766
Oh?

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.730
You've seen that far, huh?

00:18:30.566 --> 00:18:32.326
Your Shadow is you, Zola.

00:18:32.833 --> 00:18:35.333
Something you can't
separate yourself from.

00:18:35.733 --> 00:18:37.973
It's the manifestation of
the Darkness itself.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.530
Is that why he never spoke, maro?

00:18:41.566 --> 00:18:42.226
Zola...

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.800
Alright, then.

00:18:44.066 --> 00:18:48.596
If the bonds you speak of can
surpass the power of the Darkness,

00:18:49.966 --> 00:18:51.296
then prove it.

00:18:51.733 --> 00:18:53.433
That's what I plan to do, Zola.

00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:55.673
I won't hold back anymore.

00:18:56.233 --> 00:18:58.403
If I take one of you down,
then that's the end of it.

00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:04.226
Are you sure, Blue Dragon?

00:19:04.566 --> 00:19:05.966
Save it.

00:19:06.333 --> 00:19:10.673
I'll do as I please.
I thought I told you that.

00:19:11.266 --> 00:19:11.926
Thank you.

00:19:13.533 --> 00:19:15.773
Let's settle this now, Zola!

00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:21.596
Shu!

00:19:21.633 --> 00:19:23.303
Zola!

00:19:33.366 --> 00:19:34.366
There!

00:19:36.833 --> 00:19:37.873
Too slow!

00:19:40.833 --> 00:19:41.833
We shouldâ€”

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.100
No, hold it.

00:19:43.733 --> 00:19:45.233
Let's leave this to Shu.

00:19:45.833 --> 00:19:46.503
What?

00:19:46.766 --> 00:19:50.466
Even if we try to help him,
we'll probably just get in the way.

00:19:50.766 --> 00:19:52.926
So just leave it to Shu, maro.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.600
What's going on?

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:56.500
I don't know why,

00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:01.333
but Shu and Blue Dragon are
completely different from before.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.130
I wonder if they've
attained enlightenment

00:20:09.166 --> 00:20:10.926
when they got absorbed
by the Darkness.

00:20:11.133 --> 00:20:12.533
They're overpowering Zola.

00:20:13.466 --> 00:20:14.466
Let's go.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:15.800
Maro!

00:20:15.833 --> 00:20:17.933
Let's prepare to reseal
the Darkness while we can!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:18.970
- Right!
- Right!

00:20:35.333 --> 00:20:36.533
Conquer!

00:20:42.733 --> 00:20:44.973
Crushing Nail!

00:21:22.766 --> 00:21:23.426
Here she comes!

00:21:23.466 --> 00:21:24.126
Too slow!

00:21:24.533 --> 00:21:27.033
Hornet Blaster!

00:21:27.866 --> 00:21:30.196
Blue Explosion!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:42.700
Did that do it?!

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:55.770
Just what you'd expect
from Blue Dragon.

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.330
I suppose.

00:21:58.233 --> 00:22:03.203
Well then, I guess I'll use a bit
more of the Darkness power.

00:22:12.366 --> 00:22:13.366
What is that?!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:32.500
That's...

00:22:33.333 --> 00:22:34.333
Zola...

00:24:16.833 --> 00:24:21.673
Blue Dragon, I was really happy
that you chose me.

00:24:22.433 --> 00:24:23.433
And yet...

00:24:23.966 --> 00:24:24.966
I'm sorry.

00:24:25.766 --> 00:24:32.126
Alright. Let's go, Blue Dragonâ€”
to protect everyone, and our world.

00:24:32.800 --> 00:24:35.230
Next on Blue Dragon:
Shu
